### Step 4: Triggers
The sync function `syncAll()` / `syncClicktoools()` is triggered via:
1. **Scheduled Cron**: [`cron.js`](file:///c:/Users/ankita/Downloads/flowapis/veolyn/netlify/functions/cron.js) (Runs periodically in the background).
2. **Manual Sync Endpoint**: [`sync.js`](file:///c:/Users/ankita/Downloads/flowapis/veolyn/netlify/functions/sync.js) or [`resync.js`](file:///c:/Users/ankita/Downloads/flowapis/veolyn/netlify/functions/resync.js) (`POST /api/sync`).
3. **On-Demand Auto-Recovery**: [`proxy.js`](file:///c:/Users/ankita/Downloads/flowapis/veolyn/netlify/functions/proxy.js#L49-L51) (If the cookie pool in the database is found empty upon serving a request, it automatically fires `syncAll()` asynchronously).

