### Database Storage Example (Supabase / Postgres / MongoDB)

When saving to your database, make sure to invalidate old active cookies first:

```javascript
// Example for Supabase/PostgreSQL:
async function saveCookiesToSupabase(cookies) {
  // 1. Mark existing active cookies as inactive
  await supabase
    .from("pool_cookies")
    .update({ is_active: false })
    .eq("source", "clickssy")
    .eq("is_active", true);

  if (cookies.length === 0) return;

  // 2. Insert new active cookies
  const { error } = await supabase.from("pool_cookies").insert(cookies);
  if (error) throw error;
}
```